msgctxt "408"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!?"
msgstr "Zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Hey, the hell's this? Nobody told me anythin' about some\r\n"
"buff-ass uncle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"(He got away... Guess all I can do now is wait for the men\r\n"
"from earlier to come back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"(Huh, I wonder where Haruka went. Guess I just need to wait\r\n"
"for those punks from before to come back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Listen, princess. I get that you're cute n' all, but ya\r\n"
"can't go musclin' your way into our turf like it's the\r\n"
"simplest damn thing in the world. Who ya work for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr "Io, ehm..."

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Haruka? What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"So, the bossman decides to come showin' his face. And what\r\n"
"a face it is. You tryin' to steal our territory, old man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"No. But if you want to start trouble with that girl, you're gonna have to go"
" through me first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Fine by me. Bring it, wrinkleface!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!?"
msgstr "Zio Kaz?"

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"Whoa, I don't want no part of this uncle dude! I'm outta\r\n"
"here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"(He got away... Guess all I can do now is wait for the men\r\n"
"from earlier to come back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"(Huh, I wonder where Haruka went. Guess I just need to wait\r\n"
"for those punks from before to come back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Haruka? What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Huh? I... No!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Hm? Who are you? What do you want with this child?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Hey! Ma'am, wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Haruka!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"You there! Why would a child run away at the mere sight of\r\n"
"you? Let's get you down to the station for a few questions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"(I don't have time for this. Better get out of here while\r\n"
"I still can.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "That's what I'm talkin' about! Good work, girlie!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Here ya go. 10 grand. Don't spend it all in one place, heh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "876"
msgid "That's a lot of money. What's it for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell're you, man!?"
msgstr "Eh? Chi cazzo sei!?"

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Uhhh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"Counterfeit credit cards? You two should be ashamed of yourselves for using "
"a child in some two-bit scam!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Aw, shit! Who are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter who he is. He better get walkin' if he ever wants to walk "
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"I'm not going anywhere. It's time I teach you what happens\r\n"
"when you take advantage of a helpless child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "(Another sleazeball talking to Haruka... What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Interrupt them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid ""
"(Even if I stepped in, I don't think Haruka would tell me\r\n"
"anything. Guess I'll just wait and see what happens.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "(This guy's yakuza through and through. What now?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "Interrupt them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"(Even if I stepped in, I don't think Haruka would tell me\r\n"
"anything. Guess I'll just wait and see what happens.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "(Yet another \"customer\"... Hm.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
